<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5">Ph=E1=BA=A7n 11:=
 Vite vs Webpack - Build Tool Evolution</h2>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=8C=B1 Ngu=
=E1=BB=93n G=E1=BB=91c &amp; Motivation: The Build Tool Revolution</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Problem Statement</stron=
g>: As JavaScript applications grew in complexity, build times became a sig=
nificant bottleneck in developer productivity. Traditional bundlers process=
 all files upfront, causing slow start times v=C3=A0 rebuild cycles.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Historical Context</stro=
ng>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Early Web (1995-2005)</=
strong>: Static HTML/CSS/JS files, no build process needed</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>AJAX Era (2005-2010)</s=
trong>: Concatenation v=C3=A0 minification tools emerge</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Module Bundlers (2010-2=
015)</strong>: RequireJS, Browserify address dependency management</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Webpack Era (2015-2020)=
</strong>: Universal bundler dominance, complex configuration</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>ESM + HTTP/2 Era (2020+=
)</strong>: Native modules enable new architectural approaches</li>
</ul>
