<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=8E=AF Con=
clusion: The Journey Continues</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Mengmeng's interview t=E1=BA=A1i=
 Baidu represents m=E1=BB=99t milestone quan tr=E1=BB=8Dng trong career jou=
rney. T=E1=BB=AB g=C3=B3c nh=C3=ACn Principal Engineer, t=C3=B4i th=E1=BA=
=A5y potential r=C3=B5 r=C3=A0ng - solid fundamentals, growth mindset, v=C3=
=A0 genuine curiosity about technology.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Nh=E1=BB=AFng key takeaways:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Technical breadth is go=
od, but depth matters more</strong>: Better to deeply understand core conce=
pts than superficially know many frameworks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Production experience i=
s irreplaceable</strong>: Academic knowledge needs to be supplemented with =
real-world challenges</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Communication skills ar=
e as important as coding skills</strong>: Ability to explain complex concep=
ts simply is crucial for senior roles</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Systems thinking develo=
ps over time</strong>: Start by understanding individual components, gradua=
lly zoom out to see the bigger picture</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Continuous learning is =
non-negotiable</strong>: Technology evolves rapidly, successful engineers a=
dapt and stay curious</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Mengmeng's journey t=E1=BB=AB "s=
cared the hell out of me" =C4=91=E1=BA=BFn confidently discussing advanced =
topics shows growth potential. With focused effort on the areas outlined ab=
ove, progression to Senior Engineer level l=C3=A0 completely achievable.</p=
>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Remember: <strong>Every Principa=
l Engineer started exactly where you are now</strong>. The difference is pe=
rsistence, continuous learning, v=C3=A0 willingness to step outside comfort=
 zones.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Keep coding, keep learning, v=C3=
=A0 most importantly - keep asking "why?" =F0=9F=9A=80</p>
<hr class=3D"border-border-300 my-2">
